    Qwen3-0.6B tokenizer, Copyright Alibaba Cloud (Qwen Team).
  - src/diffucore/conditioning/t5_tokenizer.json
    google-t5/t5-11b tokenizer, Copyright Google LLC.

The CLIP tokenizer (src/diffucore/conditioning/clip_tokenizer.json) is from
